WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.360
This film looks at games.

2
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.160
I love playing board games.

3
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.080
I play them every Sunday with my friends.

4
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.240
What board games do you have at home?

5
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.160
I have Monopoly, the Cardiff version.

6
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.840
At home I have chess and Scrabble.

7
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.640
What games do you have at home?

8
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.800
Scrabble and Monopoly.

9
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.920
And how often do you play Monopoly?

10
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:29.960
In the holidays.

11
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.600
I don’t really get the chance to play board games.

12
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.640
And how often do you play Scrabble?

13
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.600
Mostly on the weekends.

14
00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.360
Do you like playing chess?

15
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.000
No.

16
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.120
I would like to play chess but it’s too hard.

17
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:42.680
Are you good at chess?

18
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.400
I’m not bad

19
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.960
but I think I’m the best in my family.

20
00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.520
Do you think that games like

21
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.240
chess should be in the Olympics?

22
00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.280
Yes, because it needs a lot of practice.

23
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.560
I don’t think chess should be in the Olympics

24
00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.280
because it’s more of an intellectual game.

25
00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.640
I think they should have their separate Olympics.
